Grammar tables
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The tables in data/tables (tsv files held in the program) and those left in
code in internal/parse and internal/token (particles, endings, pieces, and the
closed lists of the token layer) are our own work (CC0). They were written from the authors' own knowledge of Korean grammar and
checked against counts observed in our own corpus work; no dictionary or
third-party list is copied into this repository.
